# Report evidence

The numerical source is experiment-repo revision 9b8ba6aacc9c62f0b8a0644e0d146ee42dc6401b: results/runs.csv (150 estimates), results/summary.csv (three mean absolute errors), results/fit.json (OLS slope and intercept), results/provenance.json (Python 3.11.2, NumPy 2.4.6, PCG64, draw order) and analysis/README.md (method and theoretical interpretation).

These sources were inspected before drafting. All report numerical statements use their values. The report embeds presentation/pi_error_table.md verbatim from figtab-repo revision 21eb8e4cc742d36123e23e6c429cc459764f376f; its provenance records the same analysis revision. Displayed values agree with source MAEs to six significant digits. No external dataset or literature citation is needed: the supplied objective defines the simulation, and the theoretical comparison follows directly from binomial variance.
